# enabled|label|source_path|destination_mode|destination_value|sync_stop_file|isolation_mode
# destination_mode values:
#   same-name   -> remote uses basename(source_path)
#   fixed       -> remote uses destination_value exactly
#   default-root -> remote uses FILE_DEFAULT_DESTINATION_ROOT/destination_value
# isolation_mode values:
#   single      -> source_path is one independently protected backup
#   children    -> each immediate child directory is an independently protected backup
# Example entries only. Replace these paths with directories from your own server.

1|workspace|/srv/projects|fixed|projects/workspace|.nosync|children
0|site-webroot|/var/www/example.com|fixed|sites/example.com|.nosync|single
